<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρ-ητέον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρ-έα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must attempt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				19a
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείζοσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					9.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρητέα</span>”
				<i>one must attack,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.118
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must argue dialectically,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span> to a conclusion, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				120b8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρ-ητέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>to
				be attempted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅμως δὲ καὶ τοῦτο ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
